// An empty `Set()` delivered straight into a union of two set types at every position: it
// takes the first arm it fits, so `is` of the other arm is false (owner ruling 2026-11-15).
// The un-annotated face has no union to deliver into: its `Set()` is open and fits every
// test of its kind (D16047), so that face's cells print 0 by design.
//
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/README.md, "Template format".
// @@PRELUDE@@
type __L = Set<i32> | Set<string>
// @@VALUE@@
Set()
// @@TYPE@@
__L
// @@TEST@@
v is Set<string>
// @@HIT@@
print(0)
// @@MISS@@
print(42)
// @@WANT@@
42
